Tandem — third-party attributions
=================================

Place data
----------
geo/gazetteer.json is derived from the GeoNames "cities5000" and
"admin1CodesASCII" dumps, filtered to the United States and the six GCC states
and reduced to name, region, country, coordinates and population.

  GeoNames — https://www.geonames.org/
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Regenerate with:
  node tools/build-gazetteer.mjs <cities5000.txt> <admin1CodesASCII.txt>

